# ============================================================================
#  notepad2md — 构建产物与 IDE 生成物（永不入库）
# ============================================================================

# ---- 编译产物 ----
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.res
*.manifest.tmp

# ---- 构建目录 ----
build/obj/
bin/
Release/
Release64/
Debug/
Debug64/
dist/

# ---- Visual Studio / VS Code ----
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.aps
*.VC.db
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.ipch
*.ncb

# ---- MinGW / CMake ----
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile.bak

# ---- 运行时生成的配置（用户本地设置，不进仓库）----
*.ini

# ---- 系统垃圾 ----
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ---- 临时文件 ----
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~
*.swp
*.log
_build_*.txt

# ---- 归档（源码已入库，不再需要分发压缩包）----
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# ---- 测试用的临时语料 / 大文件（不入库）----
tests/_sweep/
tests/_t_*.md
tests/_t_*.txt
tests/llms-full-cn.txt
tests/*副本*.md
tests/probe_*.c
# 用户真实业务语料（内部接口规划文档），不入公开仓库
tests/01-user-login.md
tests/README.md

# ---- 开发时留在根目录的一次性探针/截图（不入库）----
/build/ref_ui.png
